WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Start with the long blue hand at twelve. We have counted zero minutes.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Move to one. We passed five little ticks. That is five minutes, not one minute.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Move to two. Another five minutes. Five plus five makes ten.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Move to three. Count with me: five, ten, fifteen. The number three means fifteen minutes.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Keep counting to six: twenty, twenty-five, thirty. Six groups of five make thirty minutes.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Remember: use the clock number to count groups of five. Do not read it as the number of minutes.
